# Keep the common laptop firmware needed by the project's low-power Intel
# target and common Wi-Fi adapters. The aggregate firmware-linux-nonfree and
# firmware-misc-nonfree packages pull unrelated GPU/server blobs (including
# NVIDIA and Marvell bundles) into every ISO; brave-os-hwdetect can install
# additional signed Debian firmware when a connected device needs it.
firmware-linux-free
firmware-iwlwifi
firmware-realtek
firmware-atheros
firmware-brcm80211
firmware-intel-graphics
intel-microcode
amd64-microcode
